-22T02:14:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134397548,imgsize-74038.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[I didn't go to war so...: Hindu American Army veteran Ruchir Bakshi pushes back hatred, slams call to 'tear down' Texas Hanuman statue]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134397507.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/i-didnt-go-to-war-so-hindu-american-army-veteran-ruchir-bakshi-pushes-back-hatred-slams-call-to-tear-down-texas-hanuman-statue/articleshow/134397507.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/i-didnt-go-to-war-so-hindu-american-army-veteran-ruchir-bakshi-pushes-back-hatred-slams-call-to-tear-down-texas-hanuman-statue/articleshow/134397507.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T01:56:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134397522,imgsize-146708.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 1999, just 15 island foxes remained on each of two California islands; captive breeding...]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134397440.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[On San Miguel and Santa Rosa islands, the island fox population faced a dire threat of extinction due to predation by golden eagles. The successful removal of these eagles, combined with dedicated captive breeding and habitat restoration programs, allowed the foxes to make a remarkable recovery. As a result, these subspecies were ultimately delisted from the endangered species list.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/in-1999-just-15-island-foxes-remained-on-each-of-two-california-islands-captive-breeding-and-ecosystem-restoration-pulled-the-species-back-from-extinction/articleshow/134397440.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/in-1999-just-15-island-foxes-remained-on-each-of-two-california-islands-captive-breeding-and-ecosystem-restoration-pulled-the-species-back-from-extinction/articleshow/134397440.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T01:33:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134397469,imgsize-1485140.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Canada synagogue shooting: Injured cop identified as Jeff Smith, shooter 29-year-old Sean Ward in critical condition]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134396834.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/canada-synagogue-shooting-injured-cop-identified-as-jeff-smith-shooter-29-year-old-sean-ward-in-critical-condition/articleshow/134396834.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/canada-synagogue-shooting-injured-cop-identified-as-jeff-smith-shooter-29-year-old-sean-ward-in-critical-condition/articleshow/134396834.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T00:25:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134396853,imgsize-162870.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Muhammad Ali’s 1915 Los Angeles mansion was bought for $2.5 million in 2001]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134396541.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The legendary mansion of Muhammad Ali in Los Angeles has been sold for a remarkable $8.5 million. Designed in the elegant Italian Renaissance style, this exquisite property was built in 1915 and boasts original architectural details. With nine bedrooms and seven bathrooms, this iconic home in Fremont Place embarks on a fresh journey for its new owners.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/muhammad-alis-1915-los-angeles-mansion-was-bought-for-2-5-million-in-2001-restored-while-retaining-its-tiffany-stained-glass-listed-for-nearly-17-million-and-finally-sold-for-8-5-million-in-2024/articleshow/134396541.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/muhammad-alis-1915-los-angeles-mansion-was-bought-for-2-5-million-in-2001-restored-while-retaining-its-tiffany-stained-glass-listed-for-nearly-17-million-and-finally-sold-for-8-5-million-in-2024/articleshow/134396541.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-22T00:19:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134396758,imgsize-2292250.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Five British schoolgirls built a robot with folding arms designed to create wildfire firebreaks]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134394841.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Five schoolgirls from Kent have built a robot to combat wildfires. Their innovative design features five-meter folding arms for clearing vegetation effectively. This remarkable achievement earned them the chance to represent Great Britain at an international robotics competition. The team will compete in South Korea, showcasing their solution to environmental challenges. They aim to inspire more girls into STEM fields through this global opportunity.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/five-british-schoolgirls-aged-14-and-15-built-a-robot-with-five-metre-folding-arms-designed-to-create-wildfire-firebreaks-their-two-year-old-robotics-club-is-now-representing-great-britain-globally/articleshow/134394841.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/five-british-schoolgirls-aged-14-and-15-built-a-robot-with-five-metre-folding-arms-designed-to-create-wildfire-firebreaks-their-two-year-old-robotics-club-is-now-representing-great-britain-globally/articleshow/134394841.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-21T23:56:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134396368,imgsize-1598333.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Too difficult to care for them': Florida mom tries to kill 2 autistic sons after husband’s death]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134395185.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/too-difficult-to-care-for-them-florida-mom-tries-to-kill-2-autistic-sons-after-husbands-death/articleshow/134395185.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/too-difficult-to-care-for-them-florida-mom-tries-to-kill-2-autistic-sons-after-husbands-death/articleshow/134395185.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-21T23:13:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134395272,imgsize-456816.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[386-acre Washington ranch with converted grain silos, pond and water rights lists at $895K]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/